# Stage 16: O9 target end-effector pose: constraint loss + gripper collision loss + path loss (paper Eq. 4).
sensor_msgs/Image rgb           # for the overlay
sensor_msgs/Image depth
sensor_msgs/CameraInfo camera_info
sensor_msgs/Image obstacle_exclude   # mono8: the task objects' masks, kept out of the obstacle cloud
Constraint constraint
ObjectModel active
ObjectModel passive
geometry_msgs/Pose cam_t_ee_start
geometry_msgs/Pose grasp_t_obj  # Phi
float64 grasp_width
float64 grasp_depth
---
bool success
string message
bool ok                         # rho within tolerance
geometry_msgs/Pose cam_t_ee_target
geometry_msgs/Pose cam_t_active_target
float64 constraint_loss
float64 collision_loss
float64 path_loss
sensor_msgs/Image overlay
